# check it with `sha256sum -c tools/verus/SHA256SUMS`, unpack, set KUTHA_VERUS_BIN to the `verus` binary.
# Run with RUSTUP_TOOLCHAIN=<rustc>: Verus needs this rustc, not the workspace pin in rust-toolchain.toml.
